# Files where the port's output differs from the hosted formatter.
# Baseline: 67 files, grouped by the first mismatch only, not by root cause.
# Program-changing: semicolon-separated statements concatenated (2).
# Program-changing: case branches joined (3).
# Program-changing: macro text loses end (1).
# Assignment and enum alignment (17).
# Multiline collections collapsed (18).
# Multiline calls or declarations collapsed (6).
# Multiline boolean expressions collapsed (2).
# Missing space after a proc literal's opening brace (3).
# Extra space in empty blocks (2).
# Inline comment alignment lost (7).
# Inline comments moved to a new line (3).
# Indentation changed (3).
